{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$\\begin{align}\nk^{^{\\scriptsize -\\dfrac{1}{6}}}\u0026=k^{^{\\footnotesize (-1)\\cdot\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{6}}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left(k^{-1}\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{6}}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\sqrt[6]{k^{-1}}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo $\\left(k^{-1}\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{6}}}$ and $\\sqrt[6]{k^{-1}}$ are both correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\\dfrac{1}{k^6}\u0026=\\left(k^6\\right)^{-1}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=k^{-6}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026\\neq k^{^{\\scriptsize -\\dfrac{1}{6}}}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo $\\dfrac{1}{k^6}$ isn't correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, these are the correct answers:\n\n- $\\left(k^{-1}\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{6}}}$\n- $\\sqrt[6]{k^{-1}}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Which expressions are equivalent to $k^{^{\\scriptsize -\\dfrac{1}{6}}}$ ?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\left(k^{-1}\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{6}}}$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\sqrt[6]{k^{-1}}$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\dfrac{1}{k^6}$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
